  "body": "**Suggestion**\r\n\r\n## Stage 1 Wish\r\n\r\nAllowing to restrict the ability to do replies in a room forcing users to use threads\r\n\r\n## Stage 2 Wish\r\n\r\nRestricting replies in the main timeline but allowing it inside of threads to be used\r\n\r\n## Stage 3 Wish\r\n\r\nPowerlevel support for arbitrary relations.\r\n\r\n**Background**\r\n\r\nRooms like TWIM (sadly) are prone to heavy and long offtopic discussions. It would be amazing to force people into thread usage to avoid main-timeline noise significantly.",
